	<section xml:id="rest-api">
		<title>REST API</title>

		<p>
			Now that we have more HTTP methods, we have more choices about how to build our
			app. While there are no inviolable rules about using these HTTP methods, there
			are conventions. One important one is called <url
			href="https://www.redhat.com/en/topics/api/what-is-a-rest-api">REST</url>, for
			Representational State Transfer.
		</p>
	</section>
